{
  "name": "Keystone W5 · opportunity-watcher (Wed 12:00)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## W5 · opportunity-watcher\nEvery Wednesday at 12:00 (or POST /webhook/opportunity-watcher) it reads the latest ML engineer ads Keystone analysed and posts up to 3 internship or graduate openings to #opportunities, with the skills they ask for. Links go to the original ad.\n\n**Credentials:** Discord webhook for #opportunities. Edit **Config** (app URL).",
